going Relation(s)\nL46: (S)-α-hydroxyglutarate-γ-lactone (【15†CHEBI:73673】) has functional parent (S)-2-hydroxyglutarate(2−) (【16†CHEBI:16782】)\nL47: (S)-α-hydroxyglutarate-γ-lactone (【15†CHEBI:73673】) is a monocarboxylic acid anion (【17†CHEBI:35757】)\nL48: (S)-α-hydroxyglutarate-γ-lactone (【15†CHEBI:73673】) is conjugate base of (S)-α-hydroxyglutaric acid-γ-lactone (【18†CHEBI:73677】)\nL49: Incoming Relation(s)\nL50: (S)-α-hydroxyglutaric acid-γ-lactone (【18†CHEBI:73677】) is conjugate acid of (S)-α-hydroxyglutarate-γ-lactone (【15†CHEBI:73673】)\nL51: IUPAC Name\nL52: ---\nL53: (2S)-5-oxotetrahydrofuran-2-carboxylate\nL54: \nL55: Synonym s   | Source\nL56: --- | ---\nL57: (2S)-5-oxo-2-oxolanecarboxylate  | SUBMITTER\nL58: (2S)-5-oxooxolane-2-carboxylate  | SUBMITTER\nL59: tetrahydro-5-oxo-(2S)-2-furancarboxylate  | SUBMITTER\nL60: \nL61: UniProt Name   | Source\nL62: --- | ---\nL63: (S)-α-hydroxyglutarate-γ-lactone  | UniProt\nL64: \nL65: Manual Xrefs  | Databases\nL66: --- | ---\nL67: 【19†CPD-13414†bioregistry.io】  | MetaCyc\n"}
